subject only to the terms of the GPL v2 itself. Nothing in this file
or in any separate ThinForge EULA is intended to impose any additional
restriction on those GPL-granted rights. To the extent any provision of
the ThinForge EULA would conflict with the GPL v2 with respect to those
components, the GPL v2 governs.


